      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and caring neighborhood staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents in Rogers Park frequently praise the veterinarians and office staff for their warmth, empathy, and dedication. Reviewers recount instances where team members went above and beyond, such as assisting a distressed owner at home with a carrier. While a couple of reviewers noted staff turnover or inexperience, most clients report supportive visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Detailed consultations with callback delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Consultations within the exam room receive praise for clear explanations and thoughtful guidance. Veterinarians take time to talk through diagnosis steps and treatment plans. However, several reviewers outside the exam room report difficulties obtaining timely phone callbacks from medical staff or prompt prescription refills."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate handling for vulnerable pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the gentle, thoughtful approach shown to dogs and cats during routine checkups, illness visits, and end-of-life care. Clients mention that staff prepare quiet rooms in advance for reactive or fearful animals. Pet owners dealing with pet loss especially appreciate the dignified, peaceful environment provided by the team."
      }
    }
  ],
